id: pm-jndg9a
title: Exclude the generated CHANGELOG.md from the npm tarball so publication weight stops growing with release history
description: "CHANGELOG.md is the largest file in the published distribution: 540,789 B of the 19,995,810 B base distribution measured on main 0fff5d35b (2026-11-13), against a 20,000,000 B ceiling, so 4,190 B are left. It is generated from closed tracker items on every release cut, so it grows with each PR bundle (the default-output economy bundle added about 9.8 KB, mostly changelog migration lines) and forces a new size tranche before almost every feature PR. Nothing reads it from an installed package: no source module opens it at runtime, the release workflow and release-notes generator read the repository checkout, and the only packaged references are two relative links in docs/README.md and one guide-topic doc entry. Release history stays available on GitHub Releases and in the repository. Duplicate check: searched exclude CHANGELOG npm tarball package files; an earlier docs-hygiene chore (closed) unpublished PRD.md and called a CHANGELOG slimming goal superseded by auto-generation, without deciding whether the file must ship."
type: Task
status: closed
priority: 1
tags[4]: artifact,npm,package-size,release
created_at: "2026-11-13T15:15:00.914Z"
updated_at: "2026-11-13T16:34:04.041Z"
closed_at: "2026-11-13T16:34:03.018Z"
completed_at: "2026-11-13T16:34:03.018Z"
author: "harness:claude-code"
estimated_minutes: 40
acceptance_criteria: "package.json files excludes CHANGELOG.md and the package-artifact gate reports the regained headroom; Packaged pages link the changelog by its canonical GitHub URL with the repository-only note, and the release guide topic marks it optional; The docs reachability, guide-topic and release-readiness checks pass, and no runtime feature, type or export is removed"
parent: pm-998juj
risk: low
confidence: high
resolution: "Removed CHANGELOG.md from package.json files; docs/README.md links the changelog by its canonical GitHub URL with the repository-only note; the release guide topic marks CHANGELOG.md optional and repository-only. No runtime feature, type or export changed."
expected_result: "The package-artifact gate reports regained headroom and the docs, guide-topic and release-readiness checks pass"
actual_result: "Base distribution 19,455,001 of 20,000,000 B before this bundle's code (544,999 B headroom, from 4,190 B) and 19,489,601 B with it; npm pack no longer lists CHANGELOG.md; docs/skills, docs-topology and the release-readiness spec pass"
